 "rule": {
  "text": "For each language L in {go, typescript, javascript, python}: GitHub search language:L stars:>5000 archived:false fork:false pushed:>2025-11-03, sorted by stars desc, top 40. Walk in order and take the first 3 that pass: not in the tuned list (ky, excalidraw, trpc, express, eslint, NodeBB, pytest, werkzeug); no GitHub topic in {algorithm, algorithms, education, interview, interview-preparation, awesome, awesome-list, snippets, learning-resources, learn, tutorial, tutorials, roadmap}; git tree not truncated; 100 to 3000 files with the language's extensions (go: .go; ts: .ts/.tsx/.mts/.cts; js: .js/.mjs/.cjs/.jsx; py: .py), excluding node_modules/vendor/dist/build paths; root marker present (go.mod; tsconfig.json; package.json; pyproject.toml or setup.py). SHA = default branch head at selection time.",
  "applied_on": "2026-11-03",
  "applied_by": "the maintainer's local session, via GitHub search; this cloud session's GitHub token is scoped to the maintainer's own repositories and cannot run that search, so the resulting list is recorded here as given",
  "substitution": "none. A held-out repo whose toolchain truth cannot be built is reported as truth unavailable with the reason; no other repo is swapped in.",
  "tuned": {
